$bog_id_row $mol_button_minor
	current false
	attr *
		^
		bog_id_row_current <= current
	sub /
		<= Face $mol_view
			sub <= face /
		<= Info $mol_view
			sub <= info /
				<= Name $mol_view
					sub /
						<= name \
				<= Note $mol_view
					sub /
						<= note \
		<= Tail $mol_view
			sub <= tail /
